{
  "version": 1,
  "tracks": [
    {
      "id": "judge-001",
      "text": "各位居民，欢迎来到灯塔镇狼人杀圆桌。法官将全程主持，请听从阶段提示。",
      "src": "/ai-town/assets/audio/lighthouse-town/judge/judge-001.m4a",
      "voice": "Tingting (zh_CN, local macOS voice)",
      "aiGenerated": true,
      "sha256": "bc51e9cd294c1317ef4ed34aada13c08fb1ef725c3f90586c35991abcb2c9ad8"
    },
    {
      "id": "judge-002",
      "text": "请九位玩家按座位号入座。上帝观察者可以看到全局，但不会替玩家行动。",
      "src": "/ai-town/assets/audio/lighthouse-town/judge/judge-002.m4a",
      "voice": "Tingting (zh_CN, local macOS voice)",
      "aiGenerated": true,
      "sha256": "277b7516e153a13c3572916b32bb7ab709a66f7524f0459de6bec525f84fc71d"
    },
    {
      "id": "judge-003",
      "text": "身份已经分发。狼人、预言家、女巫、猎人和平民请确认自己的身份；现在准备入夜。",
      "src": "/ai-town/assets/audio/lighthouse-town/judge/judge-003.m4a",
      "voice": "Tingting (zh_CN, local macOS voice)",
      "aiGenerated": true,
      "sha256": "d9d21c8a8145650d9d9988d51cac06340f9f97fb7d725d47d9f5bf7f2841768b"
    },
    {
      "id": "judge-004",
      "text": "天黑请闭眼。狼人请睁眼，商量今晚的目标。",
      "src": "/ai-town/assets/audio/lighthouse-town/judge/judge-004.m4a",
      "voice": "Tingting (zh_CN, local macOS voice)",
      "aiGenerated": true,
      "sha256": "26ec9024657fda5341942afc4c4cecf07c9046a02cde857ad36e2d3055f8acc3"
    },
    {
      "id": "judge-005",
      "text": "狼人请闭眼。预言家请睁眼并选择查验对象。",
      "src": "/ai-town/assets/audio/lighthouse-town/judge/judge-005.m4a",
      "voice": "Tingting (zh_CN, local macOS voice)",
      "aiGenerated": true,
      "sha256": "6ceebd4e83d50d9b61f46a9431c4810b83a93dbeab7873ccb99f9a13aa589c29"
    },
    {
      "id": "judge-006",
      "text": "预言家请闭眼。女巫请睁眼并决定是否用药。",
      "src": "/ai-town/assets/audio/lighthouse-town/judge/judge-006.m4a",
      "voice": "Tingting (zh_CN, local macOS voice)",
      "aiGenerated": true,
      "sha256": "c66815a8d3fbef0006d61da878d0083dcdef3e3bd51ab126d061384a881e9785"
    },
    {
      "id": "judge-007",
      "text": "天亮了。现在公布昨夜结果。",
      "src": "/ai-town/assets/audio/lighthouse-town/judge/judge-007.m4a",
      "voice": "Tingting (zh_CN, local macOS voice)",
      "aiGenerated": true,
      "sha256": "d57f3b22534a59f613a357314e59c7f2bf121d503d5cee92b18465bc332dd813"
    },
    {
      "id": "judge-008",
      "text": "天亮了。昨夜平安，无人离场。",
      "src": "/ai-town/assets/audio/lighthouse-town/judge/judge-008.m4a",
      "voice": "Tingting (zh_CN, local macOS voice)",
      "aiGenerated": true,
      "sha256": "5a5a6362aec5b69dbb7782a82c2f7412e730708d61bcff01ce3c78e7d900d1ef"
    },
    {
      "id": "judge-009",
      "text": "现在按座位顺序依次发言。",
      "src": "/ai-town/assets/audio/lighthouse-town/judge/judge-009.m4a",
      "voice": "Tingting (zh_CN, local macOS voice)",
      "aiGenerated": true,
      "sha256": "087c6c05bad03fb199e47bb9572dec8d5d08e8231869da7d927ea7b140445508"
    },
    {
      "id": "judge-010",
      "text": "发言结束，现在开始投票。",
      "src": "/ai-town/assets/audio/lighthouse-town/judge/judge-010.m4a",
      "voice": "Tingting (zh_CN, local macOS voice)",
      "aiGenerated": true,
      "sha256": "78370bd682ac02f1938c97745439e8f430a0f8a97eb0245389ce523bea01f985"
    },
    {
      "id": "judge-011",
      "text": "出现平票，请候选人依次补充发言。",
      "src": "/ai-town/assets/audio/lighthouse-town/judge/judge-011.m4a",
      "voice": "Tingting (zh_CN, local macOS voice)",
      "aiGenerated": true,
      "sha256": "1bec3844b09631c9796eb4013952ef9a95edf7bd668b95bac7d3e7c0fe777239"
    },
    {
      "id": "judge-012",
      "text": "补充发言结束，现在重新投票。",
      "src": "/ai-town/assets/audio/lighthouse-town/judge/judge-012.m4a",
      "voice": "Tingting (zh_CN, local macOS voice)",
      "aiGenerated": true,
      "sha256": "02c844220c8caaa229a3181727dda0244e9e97831aa6459d381172a66bd4d42d"
    },
    {
      "id": "judge-013",
      "text": "猎人可以选择发动技能，也可以放弃。",
      "src": "/ai-town/assets/audio/lighthouse-town/judge/judge-013.m4a",
      "voice": "Tingting (zh_CN, local macOS voice)",
      "aiGenerated": true,
      "sha256": "2898806e7fbfaa03f6b771d1c0f07d52173683be2634196bae19ca0a843fb4c0"
    },
    {
      "id": "judge-014",
      "text": "本局结束，现在公布身份与结果。",
      "src": "/ai-town/assets/audio/lighthouse-town/judge/judge-014.m4a",
      "voice": "Tingting (zh_CN, local macOS voice)",
      "aiGenerated": true,
      "sha256": "812fa84433f72e4ea8b499d18176fc9643f4ca3ab48a28e7bc8e020156935242"
    },
    {
      "id": "judge-015",
      "text": "现在请 你（ME） 发言。",
      "src": "/ai-town/assets/audio/lighthouse-town/judge/judge-015.m4a",
      "voice": "Tingting (zh_CN, local macOS voice)",
      "aiGenerated": true,
      "sha256": "6b894c8551937382847bbf7dbf4c3b65d1301af84197b7dac213e9cdda5bd4e7"
    },
    {
      "id": "judge-016",
      "text": "现在请 林澜 发言。",
